{"unit_id":"youqu68__dsh-delete-chat#feature-f1","repo":"youqu68/dsh-delete-chat","commit":"2bda04e9ddd8c8bd079d9e5cd2a1b6d5aef42f3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-delete-chat** 的功能「会话列表」：设置页显示会话标题、工作目录、创建时间、运行状态和归档状态，并将归档与正常会话分组展示。用户可刷新列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:425-461","src/client.js:440-459"]}
{"unit_id":"youqu68__dsh-delete-chat#feature-f2","repo":"youqu68/dsh-delete-chat","commit":"2bda04e9ddd8c8bd079d9e5cd2a1b6d5aef42f3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-delete-chat** 的功能「归档与恢复」：用户可归档会话以隐藏它，也可取消归档恢复显示。若归档被运行中的活动阻止，页面说明活动类型，并提供停止后归档的确认操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:465-497","src/client.js:235-277"]}
{"unit_id":"youqu68__dsh-delete-chat#feature-f3","repo":"youqu68/dsh-delete-chat","commit":"2bda04e9ddd8c8bd079d9e5cd2a1b6d5aef42f3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-delete-chat** 的功能「确认后删除会话」：删除前检查会话是否可删，并展示目标路径与日志文件；用户再次确认后，主机移除匹配的会话日志并清理归档和工作区关联。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:325-421","src/client.js:278-333"]}
